            <ArticleTitle>[Topical treatment of thrombophlebitis with feprazone and benzydamine. Controlled clinical study].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>880-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Topical anti-inflammatory management of superficial and deep phlebopathy with feprazone and benzidamine was compared in a double-blind test. Both drugs were active and well tolerated. Significantly less time was needed to obtain a cure with feprazone.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
